1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,800
I don't care what others think about me. I'm not born to impress others.

2
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:09,760
Every mask eventually wears you down. Every honest soul faces criticism.

3
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:15,960
I'd rather be misunderstood for being real than admired for being someone I'm not.
